su name prompt ob text "Focus the target app now. Recording from the microphone for 10 seconds before typing the transcript." be write do
su name note ob text "If ffmpeg input device differs on your OS, edit the command string below." be write do
su name record ob text "ffmpeg -y -f alsa -i default -t 10 /tmp/pyash-hear-input.wav" be command do
su name transcript from filename "/tmp/pyash-hear-input.wav" be hear do
su name typed ob name transcript to name keyboard be write do
